Tests in DeicingFlowTest:
1. fullFlow_confirmBeforeDeadline: apply slot v1 f1 09:00-10:00; clock=10:00; complete A → deadline 10:20; clock=10:19; confirm → clearance with fluidType A, confirmedAt 10:19, deadline 10:20.
2. confirmAtDeadlineRejected_thenReapply: apply slot f2; clock 10:00 complete A; clock 10:20; confirm → ConflictException; rejections contains reason; then reapply new slot 10:30-11:00 → success; complete B at 10:35 → deadline 11:10; clock 10:40 confirm → success.
3. overlapRejected: apply v1 09:00-10:00; apply v1 09:30-10:30 → 409; boundary: 10:00-11:00 OK (left-closed right-open, touching not overlap).
4. cancelRules: apply slot; cancel → CANCELLED; then overlapping slot allowed. Completed slot cancel → 409. Cancelled slot complete → 409.
5. idempotencyApply: same requestId same params → same id; different params → 409.
6. idempotencyConfirm: complete; confirm req-1 → clearance; confirm req-1 again → same clearance id, count==1; confirm req-2 → 409.
7. confirmWithoutCompletion: apply slot, don't complete; confirm → 409 + rejection recorded.

